<title>MEXICO: Grupo SYR restructures $450 mln in debt.</title>
<headline>Grupo SYR restructures $450 mln in debt.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican retailer Grupo SYR SA said on Friday it has restructured some $450 million in debt.</p>
</text>
